cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use qslab in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "qslab: Quantum Spin Liquid Laboratory"
abstract: >-
  A Python toolkit for simulating quantum spin liquids with complementary
  many-body methods: exact diagonalisation, the exact Majorana solution of the
  Kitaev model with projection onto physical states, stabilizer topological
  entanglement entropy, partons with Gutzwiller-projected variational Monte
  Carlo, DMRG and neural quantum states. It covers the Kitaev, J-K-Gamma-Gamma',
  toric-code, kagome, triangular and square J1-J2 models, includes tutorials and
  quizzes, and runs in parallel on one node, with optional MPI and GPU.
type: software
